{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1629.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"2769b9dedffd24f9378019ef9fe0573f10e524587e93de34351c6562439dc4d2","ja":"エア猫ちゃんとの交流","zh":"与空气猫咪的交流","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1629.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"5cd7fa79c9c4f91477bba478ef863141bbb697b357ffbd70bccbcdd6d232ca90","ja":"みんなノッてきたね！　さあ風花ちゃん、\n茜ちゃんたちは、パラダイスな島へレッツゴーだよ！","zh":"大家的情绪都高涨起来了呢！来吧风花，\n小茜她们要向着天堂之岛出发啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1629.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"1bc8565bbd69e878b6fe36a9245d944d7d8d5a36b5ac690cc7d86094260eca86","ja":"えっと……猫ちゃんたちが住んでいる、\nとっても素敵な島、だったわね。","zh":"那个……是住着许多猫咪的、\n非常美丽的小岛对吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1629.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"b50949dc85e613c29fdf8a0f074345420547f55d72045897599f7693bf0f854e","ja":"どの子も可愛くて、だっこしたくなっちゃうわね。\n……ええと、こんなかんじ……かしら？","zh":"每个孩子都好可爱，让人忍不住想抱抱呢。\n……那个，是这种感觉……对吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1629.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"eb91342a0541bd78d50d81447422bb6577af827e0c749b497e5d31a598425639","ja":"にゃにゃにゃー♪　猫ちゃーん、おいで～♪\n茜ちゃんが、ナデナデしてあげるからね～。","zh":"喵喵喵～♪　猫咪——，过来呀～♪\n小茜来摸摸你哦～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1629.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"a47a42a7f8032a222fcf2e6d53187417c4b959919fb4d7db17c3d62323728d97","ja":"えっと……頭はこのくらいの高さかニャ～？","zh":"那个……头差不多是在这个高度喵～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1629.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"0d8dec283bda15ce511b77d0afe67db94107a8cd0b984bd854c23520400ae3c0","ja":"わぁ～！　ふたりとも、猫ちゃんとすっごく\n仲良、し……ぷっ、ふふふっ……。","zh":"哇～！你们两个和小猫咪相处得真好\n呢……噗，呵呵呵……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1629.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"e27fde75d9bf3c3e60eceb331e0a5874b43b2549029376552e561ec71c3cd175","ja":"……あはははは！　ご、ごめん、笑っちゃって！\n猫がいないのに、いるふりをしてるのが面白くって！","zh":"……啊哈哈哈哈！抱、抱歉，我笑出来了！\n明明没有猫，却装作有猫的样子，太逗了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1629.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"87aa1b147164024ca45f62bbe61581a6c7399fd8608f5bd2b12b4e528ab653d7","ja":"ははははっ！　オレも、\n見た目がシュールすぎて、ガマンできないよ～！","zh":"哈哈哈哈！我也觉得\n这外观太超现实了，忍不住想笑啦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1629.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"03ff15089c8003a59276ad58c491a846cace726220e5c4d68e931102c73f95fd","ja":"あははっ♪　エア猫ちゃんと交流するのって、\nすっごく難しいんですね～！","zh":"啊哈哈♪　和空气小猫交流，\n真的非常困难呢～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1629.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"ba228f9380e18941c1d1bedac402c065a9fe56cba71168d74b0b961223db2051","ja":"……ふふっ。あっ、す、すみません！\n私もおふたりの奮闘っぷりを見ていたら、つい……。","zh":"……呵呵。啊，对、对不起！\n看到你们两位那么努力奋斗的样子，我也忍不住……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1629.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"6269c506848560dcbab5d76ede952dfbfee9f9f87bee4e4640bf30919c71cf98","ja":"ちょっとちょっと～！\n茜ちゃんたち、めっちゃ真剣だったのに～！","zh":"等等等等～！\n小茜她们明明超认真的～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1629.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"945bcae3dc3140b5579253896f2e097d5a82cab0f4a43d827cdaf159a2bdd277","ja":"でも……あはははは！\n確かに、変だったよね～！？","zh":"不过……啊哈哈哈哈！\n确实很奇怪对吧～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1629.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"5553751d1f96df354e94c2c6b36d488a20be6a4382f03ebbaa4a74472cafe157","ja":"私も……うふふっ♪　途中で何やってるんだろうって、\n思っちゃって、笑いをこらえるのが大変だったわ。","zh":"我也……呵呵♪ 途中忍不住想\n自己在做什么啊，差点憋不住笑呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1629.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"7cf959059d810efe85eb6528b467a198f376f1fd017b5f8ba2c78d8644a9623a","ja":"でもこれ、背景が合成されたら、\nどんな感じになるのかしら？","zh":"不过要是合成了背景，\n会变成什么样子呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1629.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"4ab7007cbd53249114858ab889fc4402ff253228ae1395134466aa4913d55e19","ja":"オンエアが楽しみだね♪　茜ちゃん、\n今日のことを思い出して、いっぱい笑っちゃうかも！","zh":"很期待节目播出呢♪　小茜，\n想起今天的事，说不定会笑个不停呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
